<Layout
  title="About Ocala Level Pros | Mobile Home Leveling Experts in Ocala & Marion County"
  description="Ocala Level Pros handles mobile home leveling, tie-downs, and under-home repairs across Marion, Sumter, and Citrus counties. Free estimates. (352) 247-3105."
  canonical="https://ocalalevelpros.com/about/"
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://ocalalevelpros.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "About", "item": "https://ocalalevelpros.com/about/"}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What areas does Ocala Level Pros serve?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We're based in Ocala and cover Marion, Sumter, and Citrus counties. That includes Silver Springs, Belleview, Summerfield, Dunnellon, Lady Lake, Citra, and the communities in between. If you're not sure whether you're in range, call (352) 247-3105 and we'll tell you straight."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Are you licensed and insured?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. We carry the licensing and insurance required for mobile home leveling and anchoring work in Florida, and we're happy to show proof before any work starts. That documentation also helps when your own insurance carrier asks who did the work."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you really give free estimates?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We do, and they're written estimates, not ballpark figures over the phone. We inspect under the home, measure, take photos, and hand you an itemized price. There's no obligation and no charge for the visit."}}]}</script>
<style is:global>
  .rich p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich li { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .rich strong { color: #2D3A35; }
  .rich a { color: #1F6D5A; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .rich a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
</Fragment>

<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #175445 0%, #1F6D5A 65%, #175445 100%);padding:72px 24px;">
  <div class="hero-grid" style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(240,168,96,0.18);color:#F0A860;border:1px solid rgba(240,168,96,0.3);">About Us</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);margin:0 0 18px;">The Crew That Works Under Ocala's Mobile Homes</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">We level, anchor, and protect mobile homes across Marion, Sumter, and Citrus counties. Free written estimates, straight answers, and a crew that shows up when we say we will.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
        <a href="tel:+13522473105" class="btn-cream">Call Now — (352) 247-3105</a>
        <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline-white">Get a Free Estimate</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-img" style="border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">
      <img src="/images/about.webp" alt="The Crew That Works Under Ocala's Mobile Homes" width="800" height="533" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } .hero-img { max-height: 320px; } }
</style>
<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Ocala Level Pros exists because too many mobile home owners around here were getting vague quotes, no-show contractors, and scary talk instead of straight answers. We do one thing: the work under your home. That means <a href="/mobile-home-leveling-ocala/">leveling</a>, <a href="/mobile-home-tie-downs-ocala/">tie-downs and anchoring</a>, <a href="/vapor-barrier-ocala/">vapor barriers</a>, and <a href="/mobile-home-skirting-ocala/">skirting</a>.</p><p>Marion County's sandy soil settles, and Florida summers push moisture up through the ground all year. Neither one is a crisis, but both will slowly work on your home if nobody checks the piers and the barrier. We crawl under, take real measurements, and show you photos of what we found. Then you get a written estimate with actual numbers, not a range that doubles once the truck is in your driveway.</p><p>A lot of our calls come from insurance and inspection deadlines. Maybe a 4-point inspection flagged your tie-downs, or a carrier wants proof of anchoring before renewal, or a closing is stuck on a leveling issue. We know those forms and those timelines, and we run a 24/7 line for exactly those situations because the deadline doesn't care about business hours.</p><p>We're licensed and insured, we serve Ocala and the surrounding towns from Belleview to Dunnellon to Lady Lake, and we'd rather earn your trust with clear work than big promises. If you want to see how pricing works before you call, our <a href="/mobile-home-leveling-cost/">leveling cost guide</a> lays it out with real numbers.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">How We Work</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">What You Can Expect</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4DCC8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(22,51,44,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#16332C;margin:0 0 8px;">Written estimates, real numbers</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">You get the price on paper before we start, itemized so you can see what each part of the job costs. No surprise add-ons once we're under the home.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4DCC8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(22,51,44,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#16332C;margin:0 0 8px;">Photos of everything</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">You probably can't crawl under your home, so we bring the crawl space to you. Before-and-after photos of piers, straps, and barriers come with every job.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4DCC8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(22,51,44,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#16332C;margin:0 0 8px;">No fear tactics</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">An out-of-level home or a loose strap is a fixable problem, not an emergency sales pitch. We tell you what needs attention now, what can wait, and what's fine.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4DCC8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(22,51,44,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#16332C;margin:0 0 8px;">Deadline-ready paperwork</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Insurance carriers and inspectors want documentation, so we provide it. If a 4-point inspection or closing date is breathing down your neck, our 24/7 line is there.</p>
      </div>
</div>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .feat-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } }
</style>
  </div></section>
<section style="padding:72px 24px;background:#F5F0E4;">
  <div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">FAQ</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3.5vw,36px);margin:0 0 32px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4DCC8;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#16332C;margin:0 0 10px;">What areas does Ocala Level Pros serve?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">We're based in Ocala and cover Marion, Sumter, and Citrus counties. That includes Silver Springs, Belleview, Summerfield, Dunnellon, Lady Lake, Citra, and the communities in between. If you're not sure whether you're in range, call (352) 247-3105 and we'll tell you straight.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4DCC8;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#16332C;margin:0 0 10px;">Are you licensed and insured?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">Yes. We carry the licensing and insurance required for mobile home leveling and anchoring work in Florida, and we're happy to show proof before any work starts. That documentation also helps when your own insurance carrier asks who did the work.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4DCC8;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#16332C;margin:0 0 10px;">Do you really give free estimates?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">We do, and they're written estimates, not ballpark figures over the phone. We inspect under the home, measure, take photos, and hand you an itemized price. There's no obligation and no charge for the visit.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #1F6D5A 0%, #2A8570 50%, #1F6D5A 100%);padding:64px 24px;text-align:center;">
  <h2 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,40px);font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-bottom:16px;">Need Help in Ocala & Marion County? Call for Same-Day Service.</h2>
  <p style="font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);margin-bottom:28px;max-width:520px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">Free written estimates. Emergency calls answered around the clock.</p>
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
    <a href="tel:+13522473105" class="btn-cream">Call Now — (352) 247-3105</a>
    <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline-white">Get Free Estimate</a>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
